<title>GERMANY: Kleinwort Benson repeats buy on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Kleinwort Benson repeats buy on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kleinwort Benson research, the investment arm of Dresdner Bank, said on Monday it has published a report reiterating its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation for shares of telecommunications group Deutsche Telekom AG.</p>
<p>&quot;Based upon cash flow multiples we are reiterating our buy recommendation up to 35 marks,&quot; said London-based analyst Tim Hirst.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097145</p>
</text>
